<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>TORE UP</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Don Toliver</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">HARDSTONE PSYCHO</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1jKXjxMWlq4BhH6f9GtZbu</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.760" end="00:06.810" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Will not change you now, whoa!)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.810" end="00:14.810" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.250" end="00:21.590">In a club with some ones and I'm piped up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.590" end="00:24.320">Shawty got me high, too high</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.320" end="00:27.460">I be steppin' on a - in some white ones</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.460" end="00:30.770">Can't control me, I think I'm too fly</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.770" end="00:34.050">Tore up, tore up, tore up, tore up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.050" end="00:36.860">Tore up, tore up (high), tore up, tore up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.860" end="00:40.000">Tore up, tore up (high), tore up, tore up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.000" end="00:43.370">Tore up, tore up (high), tore up, tore up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.370" end="00:46.430">She back-to-back, oh, she in that mode (whoo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.430" end="00:49.400">I rip her tracks out, she gotta go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.400" end="00:52.770">I hop up on my bike, it's peace and adios</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.770" end="00:57.550">It's not about where you're at, it's where you go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.550" end="01:02.820" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Will not change you now!)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.820" end="01:06.100">If you believe in yourself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.100" end="01:09.150">It will get you through it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.150" end="01:12.010">Oh, I believed in myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.010" end="01:13.970">Well, can you see what I'm doin'?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.970" end="01:17.110">In a club with some ones and I'm piped up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.110" end="01:20.160">Shawty got me high, too high</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.160" end="01:22.980">I be steppin' on a - in some white ones</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.980" end="01:26.690">Can't control me, I think I'm too fly</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.690" end="01:29.670">Tore up, tore up, tore up, tore up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.670" end="01:32.600">Tore up, tore up (high), tore up, tore up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.600" end="01:35.730">Tore up, tore up (high), tore up, tore up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.730" end="01:37.670">Tore up, tore up (high), tore up, tore up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.670" end="01:41.670" /></div></body></tt>